#* {{quote-book|year=1981|title=Petersen's Photographic Magazine - Volume 10, Issues 7-12  |author= |page=51 |ISBN= |passage=Repeat this step to make the bend at the other 39-inch mark being careful that it is also at a 90° angle to the '''vised''' pipe, and also parallel to the first bend. }}
#* {{quote-book|year=2007 |title=Phantom Waltz  |author=Catherine Anderson  |page=302 |ISBN=1101578777 |passage=“There's my girl,” he whispered. He reached back to lift each of her legs to '''vise''' her knees under his arms. }}
